<title>SINGAPORE: Pacific Century requests share suspension.</title>
<headline>Pacific Century requests share suspension.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Century Regional Developments Ltd said on Thursday it had requested the Stock Exchange of Singapore to suspend trading of its shares on June 6, 1997.</p>
<p>The company statement gave no reason for the one day suspension request.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
